A module constant computed from other module constants (a BinOp RHS that pass 0
cannot pre-register) must resolve inside a function: bodies are converted
before the module-level assignments, and are now re-converted against the
global's final type. Previously the name was unknown and the enclosing
statement dropped (a spurious failure here, and silent loss elsewhere).
